      3 / 4 * cubP 12683 hqEpsilon (85 / 100) (64 / 100) hqEnergy (hqDisplacement c)
        (hqEnergyMoment 12) (hqLocationMoment c 12)) +
      √(Dpap 12683 (splitRemovedBudget c) hqCentreCap (locationVarianceBudget c)
